      trigger_capability: "the field-projection arm of the optionality relation: extend optional_at_required_obligation_diags (src/v1/04_infer.dag) so a field read THROUGH an optional is decided at the PROJECTION position. That is the next-rung trigger already recorded by dag/gunbc/recurring_failure_mode/optional_admitted_where_a_required_value_is_declared.dag (receipt 2026-09-29, found by review 72657 on gunbc#12572; discriminating pair in test.claim.optional_field_read_admission_gap_witness: the same .first() read at a field position is admitted with zero blocking rows, at a call argument it refuses DeclaredTypeNotInhabited). OWNER BOUND, measured at main 25f66b6a844: no roadmap_authority row claims the projection position - optional-admitted-at-record-literal-field (rn_50P0GN3GQK5MSVMMKCZWWZ8YE5) disclaims it in out_of_scope and takes the field-DECLARATION position, and cardinality-optional-declaration (rn_X9MHZ7FXWXKKS32YBXJASTZJM5) is the T?-versus-explicit-Optional declaration-name class, not a read at the projection. Until a node is rostered for the projection arm, a green probe here has no owner to page. On that wall landing, the hole witness floor_cardinality_seam_field_projection_through_optional_is_still_silent is re-ranked to a regression control beside its discriminating call-argument refusal." as NonEmptyStr,
